<title>BULGARIA: Aircraft resume landing at Sofia airport.</title>
<headline>Aircraft resume landing at Sofia airport.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sofia airport resumed taking incoming flights around 1400 local time (1200 GMT) on Friday after dense fog cleared, an airport official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The airport is now functioning normally and we hope that there will be no more delays by the evening,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Dense fog prevented commercial aircraft from landing at the airport before midday and they were diverted to the Black Sea port of Bourgas. Outgoing flights were delayed in the morning. -- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
</text>
